%
%  CONVENTIONS (enforced for every entry):
%    * Titles in Sentence case -- only the first word, proper nouns and
%      acronyms are capitalised.  Protect them with an extra { } so
%      BibTeX/Biber will not lowercase them:  title = {A {PMUT} array ...}
%    * Use DOI when available; omit the URL if a DOI is present.
%    * Journal names: full name or the journal's own standard abbreviation,
%      but be consistent across the whole file.
%    * Keys:  <firstauthorlastname><year><firstkeyword>
%             e.g.  wang2023pmut,  chen2024scaln
% =============================================================

